    $ secrecy -= 2
    $ humanity += 3
  ?end
* Tell him that you are sorry, and walk away ?if _mp_n == 0
  $ b1.refuge = "none"
  $ humanity -= 2
  $ defiance -= 1
  You tell him that you are sorry. It is true, and it is no use. He says that it is quite all right. He says it as one says it to a child that has dropped a cup. You go out into the lane, and Naevia is standing by the door with her broom, looking at you with her old unfooled face, and she does not say anything at all, and it is the worst thing that she could have done. At dusk you hear the soldiers on the lane. You do not hear anything else. You have very good ears, and it is a thing that you would give a great deal not to have had.
